  "description": "\u00a7FRAMEKIT P3.1 \u2014 one frame at a time (pick it above): availability, money (the auditor's \u0394), ledger, federation, workers, OPA. Generated by scripts/hetzner_demo/frame_dashboard.py; edit there.",
