      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Treasury notify floor",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "DS_PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "description": "Whether the treasury sits below its notify floor (TREASURY_LOW_NOTIFY_THRESHOLD), as the registry's treasury watch last read it. The balance itself is not published. WATCH OFF: the floor is 0, the default, and nothing is measured. Below the floor for 10 minutes the TreasuryLow page fires. No data: the watch has not run since the registry started.",
